deactivate Table
Service --> API: 10: Handover point deleted
API --> Page: 11: HTTP 204 (no response body)
Page --> Actor: 12: Show authorized result
else Missing or ineligible context
Service --> API: 8.1: Referenced point must be temporarily closed instead
API --> Page: 8.2: HTTP 409
Page --> Actor: 8.3: Display error; do not report success
end
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
